    "description": "Salesforce sent an automated security notification on 2026-09-11 for the WagerTech Production org (00Dao00001XDY8W). Salesforce auto-froze user **005ao00000BSxOc**, revoked its access tokens, and flagged traffic routed through a high-risk anonymizing proxy.\n\n**Review completed 2026-09-11**\n\n* Traced the frozen user to the SaaScend integration account (client+wagertech@saascend.com).\n* Reviewed login history on the Production org — logins from varied locations have been occurring regularly on this account.\n* Assessed impact: no live production data in the org today, so present exposure is low.\n* Production org prompted for a Security Contact during review. Set Emily as the security contact; Jumpr phone number used as a placeholder pending a WagerTech number.\n\n**Followed up with client — email to Emily, cc Taryn, 2026-09-11**\n\n* Is the SaaScend integration still in use or planned? If not, deactivate the user.\n* Confirm the correct WagerTech security contact and phone number.\n* Recommended a WagerTech team member monitor Salesforce security notifications directly.\n\n**Open — awaiting WagerTech**\n\n1. Decision on deactivating vs. retaining the SaaScend user.\n2. Security contact name and phone number to replace the placeholder.\n\n**Recommendation**\n\nIf SaaScend is not on the roadmap, deactivate rather than unfreeze. Confirm MFA is enforced on all Production users either way.",
